      "settings": {
        "title": "",
        "content": "<p><strong>Yoga Jeevan</strong>, a flagship wellness initiative by <strong>YogaKargha (brand of AbhinehKrafts)</strong>, extends its philosophy of <em>“Practice with Purpose”</em> into the art of giving.</p><p>Our <strong>Mindful Gifting Collection</strong> redefines corporate and personal gifting with handcrafted wellness items that tell stories — of artisans, sustainability, and conscious living. Each piece is made with care, using natural materials, biodegradable packaging, and ethical production methods.</p><p>When you gift through YogaKargha, you don’t just give an object — you share a value system.</p>",
